OL,3,A'Culture shift' needed in how UK does
OL,4,Abusiness, PM urges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK needs a "culture shift" in how
OL,7,Fit does business, Andy Burnham has said
OL,8,Fahead of a meeting between some of
OL,9,FBritain's biggest bosses and the
OL,10,Fgovernment.
OL,12,FThe prime minister said those who take
OL,13,Frisks in business should be backed by
OL,14,Fgovernment and local leaders should
OL,15,Fhave the power to work with companies.
OL,17,FBurnham had been due to attend the
OL,18,Fmeeting, but cancelled his engagements
OL,19,Ffor Monday and Tuesday following the
OL,20,Fdeath of his father.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
